id: pm-beads-crk5
title: Adopt pm field-aware merge driver for multi-agent branch-merge safety
description: "Add the pm-cli 2026.7.20+ field-aware git merge driver (.gitattributes fence mapping tracker artifacts to pm-item-toon/pm-item-markdown/pm-history/pm-relationship/pm-json). Bump @unbrained/pm-cli devDep floor from none to ^2026.7.21 (driver requires 2026.7.20+). Enables conflict-free field-level merge of concurrent-branch tracker edits, append-only union of history+relationship jsonl, key-level JSON config merge. Companion epic pm-cli-website-juz0."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 3
tags[3]: 2026.7.21,merge-driver,multi-agent-merge
created_at: "2026-07-21T20:54:08.278Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-22T16:35:47.432Z"
deadline: "2026-07-28T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-22T16:35:47.431Z"
author: claude-orchestrator
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "Committed .gitattributes has pm-cli:merge-drivers fence; @unbrained/pm-cli devDep floor ^2026.7.21; lockfile synced; changelog:check passes; CI green."
resolution: Field-aware merge driver adopted (PR #38) + prepare hook made cross-platform-correct via portable Node guard (PR #40). Multi-agent branch-merge safety now works on POSIX and Windows cmd.exe.
expected_result: "prepare hook wires 5 merge drivers when pm present, skips cleanly when absent, on all platforms; .gitattributes fence committed; CI green"
actual_result: "Validated real-data: present->5 drivers wired (exit0), absent->silent skip (exit0), pm-error->fail-loud (exit1); identical via sh -c. .gitattributes fence present; devDep floor ^2026.7.21."
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind}:
