comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T20:54:08.278Z",claude-orchestrator,Part of fleet-wide juz0 epic; pm-github (PR #5) is the reference adoption.
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T20:54:08.278Z",claude-orchestrator,git config is per-clone; each fresh clone/CI runs pm merge install once. Post-merge run pm history-repair --all (upstream auto-hook tracked as pm-cli#623).
  "2026-07-22T16:35:14.394Z",claude-orchestrator,"Portable prepare-hook shipped in PR #40 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/pull/40): replaced guarded POSIX 'if command -v pm; then pm merge install; fi' with 'node scripts/prepare-merge-driver.mjs' — cross-shell correct on POSIX + Windows cmd.exe (Greptile P1 + CodeRabbit finding on xydx wave). Validated real-data: present->wire 5 drivers, absent->skip exit0, error->fail-loud exit1. Completes the cross-platform half of merge-driver adoption. Fleet rollout tracked in companion pm-cli-website-5cx1."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T20:54:08.278Z",claude-orchestrator,Field-aware driver reconciles divergent scalar fields AND unions array fields without conflict; devDep bump requires npm install --package-lock-only or npm ci fails.
